// A trimmed extract of the Public Suffix List, for the test suite.
//
// Every rule the committed tests need and nothing else: the rules the official
// checkPublicSuffix vectors turn on, the rules that decide the names in
// data/ingest/flow-sample.jsonl, and github.io / workers.dev / trafficmanager.net
// for the shared-infrastructure case. Trimmed from the snapshot fetched on
// 2026-09-03; the section markers are the list's own, and the parser reads them.
//
// It is an extract, not the list: tests/test_enrichment.py asserts that it
// produces the same answer as the full list for every one of those names, and
// the live list is fetched by a test of its own.

// ===BEGIN ICANN DOMAINS===
ac
arpa
in-addr.arpa
biz
*.ck
!www.ck
cn
com.cn
公司.cn
com
io
jp
ac.jp
kyoto.jp
*.kobe.jp
!city.kobe.jp
ide.kyoto.jp
*.mm
net
org
uk
co.uk
us
ak.us
k12.ak.us
中国
dev
// ===END ICANN DOMAINS===
// ===BEGIN PRIVATE DOMAINS===
akadns.net
akamai.net
edgesuite.net
uk.com
workers.dev
github.io
trafficmanager.net
// ===END PRIVATE DOMAINS===
